{
  "bookId": "archive-banai",
  "id": "section-21193",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "21193001",
          "sourceType": 10,
          "text": "我做视频企划五周年啦！",
          "title": "小节引文",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21193002",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "嗨多磨，我是Kizuna AI！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21193003",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "今天想跟大家聊聊我的直播。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21193004",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "我呢，是在2016年6月30日出生的。距离现在，担任虚拟主播刚好5年整！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21193005",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "整整五个365天，每天都陪在大家身边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21193006",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "我知道了各种各样的事，体验了各种各样的事，也去了不知道的世界……当然手办的世界也是！这真的是一段非常愉快的时光。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21193007",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "我啊，能和大家联系在一起真是太好了！但爱酱还想和世界上更多的大家联系在一起，所以今后也会不断进行新的挑战。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21193008",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "为了能和大家共享开心的时光，我会一直努力的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21193009",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "今后也请一直多多关照！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
